            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1) The daily update occurs at 12:00 PM, providing preliminary data until the monthly closing on the 11th day of the following month;",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Arial",
                      "color": "#ffffff"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2) During the preliminary period, there will be a daily historical update retroactive to the 1st day of the current month;",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Arial",
                      "color": "#ffffff"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3) This retroactivity is due to the container count, which is based on the start date of operations and may change numbers from previous days;",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Arial",
                      "color": "#ffffff"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4) Empty cells indicate that no data was collected on those days, whether in TEUs or schedules.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Arial",
                      "color": "#ffffff"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
